					"blocks": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"body": "The Student Emergency Housing Support at the University of Toronto provides assistance to students facing urgent housing crises, such as unsafe living conditions, evictions, or personal conflicts. This service is typically used when students find themselves in situations that threaten their ability to secure stable housing, ensuring they can continue their education without disruption. If you're in need, the support team is ready to help you find temporary or long-term housing solutions."
